e_name": "screenshot02.png", "id": "1167270421589414", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473393425_1167270424922747_1907140739452079368_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=mCkobVBtQ0wQ7kNvwH8MFSi&_nc_oc=AdoET6bdlDCxMnKwYWqNLXYJPoUAxJqBysKxjvSGMXoxqIuLqBRShEAf8aW_QOnJ9CQ&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDOiU3rtfWThvf4bfcDfKCKbAPh4lBwqY3kBeK122WrIA&oe=6A5A4579"}, {"file_name": "screenshot03.png", "id": "1320236425766559", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473392005_1320236429099892_7026969068655260219_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=E6OkUMMrvHwQ7kNvwFYljT-&_nc_oc=AdqtBQGdjvYRFq3kIfpuoSnKm_x8eA_oo1zwgT96CQs2x4u470Z8JdjGSiJtWkoGtfo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQA7kII8905CiKjpSTA2Ws50Gd4JDzcuONr5aEU6Hkbf0A&oe=6A5A1CD3"}, {"file_name": "screenshot04.png", "id": "1408931723813604", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391949_1408931727146937_1574658016866773147_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gIona-hL1hoQ7kNvwE3_JTp&_nc_oc=AdrTTokayJJiPQXmGh637WmsHVT9KHpaZ7uGbuOTDiTnpLVRXglG9WuSAM5OJtW1KDE&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQB8a1vpqxDjXe0BFpcwL-gSMuFhFRimqzlP2wxOZrhzzg&oe=6A5A287B"}, {"file_name": "screenshot05.png", "id": "418176134719567", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391998_418176138052900_6204508764481913331_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6PM-GbMxJ0MQ7kNvwEYLyh4&_nc_oc=AdpMloJEQY6ppv99c-ZVNOR-ylSnK-TWUca5a4Qo1ZdQWzf-uBIBP_HtligeUmflDIg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQDBFCZkhOe9FrZoOkJ32IibzkMnvf01d8vWt8TNrJhqqg&oe=6A5A29CA"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "thumbnail2.png", "id": "1152565683077389", "uri": "https://scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473391896_1152565689744055_250834400001166292_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=qslGsU_fiGAQ7kNvwGo-P-p&_nc_oc=AdocknwPvYtafb4SYeBCOPG-wpCO-mcvUgsO6ALU3N-YwLs2ygNBtRUZ_Lxmxx5AGe4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-dfw6-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQD2IYrJiY_1YcB41rQH8lX90CT2HZuFZnEHbavD0NHC8g&oe=6A5A4B3E"}, "display_name": "Aerodrums 2", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking.\n\nAerodrums 2 is an expressive and versatile air drumming instrument. It is a standalone device that uses high-speed optical motion capture technology to accurately track the position of your drumsticks and feet in 3D. Unlike acoustic and traditional electronic drum sets, Aerodrums 2 is lightweight and portable, it is silent when used with headphones, and it takes up no space when not in use.\n\nPaired with Meta Quest headsets, Aerodrums 2 offers an unparalleled drumming experience. Passthrough mode and depth occlusion let you see your real hands and drumsticks while drumming, while hand-tracking is used to further improve stick-tracking accuracy.\n\nTo learn more about Aerodrums 2 visit aerodrums.com", "short_description": "This is the companion app for the Aerodrums 2 air drumming instrument (sold separately). Seamlessly connect to your Aerodrums 2 device over WiFi and see your drum kit materialize before your eyes. Choose your kit, jam to your favorite tunes, practice with a metronome, or record your performances. No Aerodrums 2? No problem! The app will let you play a basic drum kit in mixed reality using hand-tracking."}]}, "developer_name": "Aerodrums", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://aerodrums.com/privacy-policy/", "developer_terms_of_se